WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.950
Messina, Sicily.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.020
Soldiers are home from a war,
and the courtyard is full.

3
00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:10.220
One young soldier stands silent,
gazing at the host's daughter.

4
00:00:10.270 --> 00:00:13.390
Two others circle each
other, firing insults.

5
00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:18.610
Before they even meet, her uncle warns:
"There is a kind of merry war betwixt

6
00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.870
Signior Benedick and her".

7
00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:21.970
Two couples.

8
00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:23.330
Two love stories.

9
00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:24.650
One comedy.

10
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:26.980
So why does Shakespeare need both?

11
00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:30.150
In this mission, you'll
map the play in five acts,

12
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.350
from the soldiers' arrival onwards.

13
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:36.510
You'll meet a third group too:
Dogberry and the bumbling night Watch.

14
00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:40.340
And you'll find the one scene
where both couples collide.

15
00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:44.680
Your mission: explain why
Shakespeare needs both love stories.
